{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-08-31 15:07:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL RATINGS EXPANDS CYBER RISK INSIGHTS PARTNERSHIP WITH GUIDEWIRE SOFTWARE', 'text': "NEW YORK , AUG. 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL RATINGS, A DIVISION OF S&P GLOBAL INC. (NYSE: SPGI), TODAY ANNOUNCED AN EXPANDED PARTNERSHIP WITH GUIDEWIRE SOFTWARE, INC. (NYSE: GWRE) WHICH DEEPENS THE LONG-STANDING RELATIONSHIP AND COUPLES GUIDEWIRE'S CYBER RISK INSIGHTS WITH S&P GLOBAL RATINGS' EXTENSIVE CREDIT KNOWLEDGE AND EXPERIENCE. CYBER RISK HAS BEEN PROPELLED INTO A VITAL, TOP RISK CONSIDERATION FOR ALL ORGANIZATIONS."}{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2021-08-31 10:51:00', 'title': 'S&P CORELOGIC CASE-SHILLER INDEX SHOWS ANNUAL HOME PRICE GAIN TOPPED 18.6% IN JUNE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, AUG. 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P DOW JONES INDICES (S&P DJI) TODAY RELEASED THE LATEST RESULTS FOR THE S&P CORELOGIC CASE-SHILLER INDICES, THE LEADING MEASURE OF U.S. HOME PRICES. DATA RELEASED TODAY FOR JUNE 2021 SHOW THAT HOME PRICES CONTINUE TO INCREASE ACROSS THE U.S. MORE THAN 27 YEARS OF HISTORY ARE AVAILABLE FOR THE DATA SERIES AND CAN BE ACCESSED IN FULL BY GOING TO HTTPS://WWW.SPGLOBAL.COM/SPDJI/.'}